# Kav Landseeker's delayed ability sacrifices its Lander only if Bot1 still controls it (CR 701.21a; the ruling: "When
# that ability resolves, if you still control the Lander token created by Kav Landseeker's last ability, you'll sacrifice
# that token"). Bot1 gives the Lander to Bot2 with Harmless Offering on turn 3; at the end step of turn 3, Bot1's next
# turn, the ability resolves and Bot2's Lander stays.

